  "question": {
    "text": "Which technique among the following, is most appropriate in separation of a mixture of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mi>mg</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math>-nitrophenol and picric acid?",
